    "title": "Weather Bulletin: Winter Storm Watch Issued for Saturday Morning Storm - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jeremy Couso ,\n5 hours ago Forecasters at the National Weather Service office in Reno have issued a Winter Storm Watch in effect from Saturday morning through Sunday evening. …WINTER STORM WATCH IN EFFECT FROM SATURDAY MORNING THROUGH SUNDAY. EVENING…. Forecasters expect heavy snow with accumulations in Lassen and eastern Plumas counties up to 6 inches... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
